   - Verify Set-Cookie header is present
   - Check if subsequent requests include PHPSESSID

2. **Enable Safari Console Logging**:
   - Verify sessionStorage is being read
   - Log each API call's headers
   - Log 401 responses

3. **Test with Different Config**:
   - Same domain for frontend & backend (would solve issue)
   - localStorage instead of sessionStorage (temporary fix)
